docs(ci): .github#364 has merged — gate-16 now says NOT APPLICABLE, not PASS

The gate-16 note added earlier in this branch described #364 as open. It
merged in the meantime, so a full-repo run with no diff now reports
`NOT APPLICABLE — full-repo run computed NO diff … This is NOT a pass.`
rather than PASS.

The measurement itself is unchanged and still worth keeping: it was taken
with the canonical package @81c8c97, which still carried the old behaviour,
so it records what the old PASS was standing over — 0 (development) / 0
(beta) / 30 (main) / 30 (report). What changes is the instruction to the
reader: a historical green gate-16 cell on this repo is not a measurement.
